	(text "U5: VM (pins 4,5) is pack minus = board GND. Keep CELL_N -> U5 -> GND short and wide.\nQ1: body diode conducts until U5 closes, then the channel turns fully on (Vgs = -Vcell).\nReversed cell: Q1 blocks the high side, U5 blocks the low side."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
