	(text "C6/C7 at VDDH, C8/C9 at VCC (VDD = REG0 output, 3.0 V via UICR.REGOUT0).\nREG0 runs as LDO (DCCH unconnected).  No 32 kHz crystal inside the module: Y1 is required.\nPWM nets avoid the low-frequency pins near the radio (P0.02-P0.05, P0.28-P0.31, P1.1x)."
