	(text "Value = back-silk label.  DBG_TX/RX: spare GPIOs, 3 V UART log port (P0.15 / P0.17).\nPROG: I_chg = V x 300 mA.  ISNS: I_motor = V / (A_IPROPI x 1.5k)."
