	(text "One board for all three toys (bird / fish / ball). 1S LiPo, protected or not.\n\nBattery voltage: SAADC VDDHDIV5 (internal), no divider.\nCharging detect: nRF USBDETECTED (VBUS), CHRG drives D2 only.\nMotor current: SAADC AIN1 (P0.03) on MOT_IPROPI, 0.6 V ref, gain 1.\nGAINSEL: drive low / drive high / input-disconnected = Hi-Z.\nMotor: DIR (IN1, static) + PWM (IN2): fwd DIR=0 PWM=duty, rev DIR=1 PWM=1-duty.\nSpeaker: PWM sample playback on SPK_PWM (~62.5 kHz carrier).\n\nHand-soldered, not JLC-assembled: J3 battery, J4 motor, J5 speaker.\nJ2 SWD: 1.27 mm pad row, unpopulated (first flash only, then USB DFU).\nH1, H2: M2 mounting holes (NPTH), diagonal corners; ISO 7380 button head (3.5 mm)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 208.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
